ltime for live synchronisation — ensure your browser is not blocking WebSocket connections. If problems persist, please contact us at care.msgreplier@gmail.com.\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] text-center space-y-4 shadow-sm max-w-xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-[#110f0f] font-heading\",\"children\":\"Still have questions?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#5d6c7b] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto\",\"children\":\"Our team is happy to help. Reach out and we'll get back to you within 24–48 hours.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/contact\",\"className\":\"font-heading font-medium text-xs bg-[#110f0f] text-white hover:bg-[#eedfc6] hover:text-[#110f0f] border border-transparent hover:border-[#d4c3ab] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 uppercase tracking-wider inline-block\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]}]]}]]}]]}],\"$undefined\",null,[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"children\":[\"$L8\",\"$L9\",null]}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},[[\"$\",\"div\",\"l\",{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] antialiased\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-16 pb-20 px-3 md:px-4 md:pt-28 md:pb-32 border-b border-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container mx-auto max-w-6xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col space-y-6 md:space-y-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 rounded-full w-40 h-6 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none motion-reduce:opacity-50\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 rounded-lg w-full h-16 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none motion-reduce:opacity-50\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 r